</header>
<main id="main">
<section class="page-hero dark">
  <div class="sun" style="--sun-t:18%;--sun-b:auto;--sun-r:-7%" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="copy">
      <h1>Three ways to work together.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Every package includes a planning call, a private online gallery, and prints. Prices start here and are confirmed once we know your plans.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="service">
  <div><h3>Portrait session</h3><p class="price">From $380</p></div>
  <div><p>For individuals, couples, and families. One location, chosen with you, in the best light of the day.</p><ul><li>60 to 90 minutes of shooting</li><li>25 edited images in a private gallery</li><li>Two 8 by 10 prints included</li></ul></div>
  <a class="btn btn-blue" href="contact.html">Ask about portraits</a>
</div>
    <div class="service">
  <div><h3>Story day</h3><p class="price">From $2,400</p></div>
  <div><p>Weddings, milestone parties, and gatherings, covered from the first arrival to the last dance.</p><ul><li>Up to 8 hours of coverage</li><li>Second photographer available</li><li>400 or more edited images</li><li>Printed album available</li></ul></div>
  <a class="btn btn-blue" href="contact.html">Ask about your day</a>
</div>
    <div class="service">
  <div><h3>Editorial and brand</h3><p class="price">From $1,200 per day</p></div>
  <div><p>Pictures for magazines, makers, and small businesses, planned around what you need to say.</p><ul><li>Shot list planned together</li><li>Preview images within 48 hours</li><li>Usage licence included</li></ul></div>
  <a class="btn btn-blue" href="contact.html">Ask about a project</a>
</div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.25rem;font-size:.95rem">All prices are in US dollars.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>How booking works</h2></div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Send an enquiry</h3><p>Tell us what you&rsquo;re planning. We reply within two working days.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Have a short call</h3><p>Twenty minutes to talk through the day, the place, and the light.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Hold your date</h3><p>A 30 percent deposit reserves the date. The rest is due a week before.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Shoot and receive</h3><p>Your gallery arrives within two weeks. Prints follow by post.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Questions we hear often</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>Do you shoot on film?</summary><p>Yes. Most sessions include a mix of digital and film, in 35mm or medium format. Tell us if you&rsquo;d like a session shot entirely on film.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you travel?</summary><p>Yes, we shoot worldwide. Travel costs are listed separately in your quote so there are no surprises.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What happens if it rains?</summary><p>Rain makes soft, even light, and we like it. If conditions are unsafe, we reschedule at no charge.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How many photographs will I receive?</summary><p>Portrait sessions include about 25 edited images, and story days include 400 or more. Every image is edited by hand.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I order extra prints?</summary><p>Yes. Prints and albums can be ordered from your gallery at any time.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div><h2>Ready when you are.</h2><p>Send a few lines and we&rsquo;ll take it from there.</p></div>
    <a class="btn btn-blue" href="contact.html">Send an enquiry</a>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
